OL,5,G1500 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith North Yorkshire's roads a big
OL,7,     Fdraw for bikers, policing them is
OL,8,     Fa top priority. A 70-year-old
OL,9,     Fbiker crashes down an embankment
OL,10,     Fbut is spared serious injury
OL,11,     Fthanks to a gadget.
OL,12,G1600 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FOfficers give high-speed pursuit
OL,14,     Fto a van with cloned plates which
OL,15,     Fsmashes through traffic near
OL,16,     FLeeds, and on the A1 a driver
OL,17,     Fclaims a mechanical fault caused
OL,18,     Fhim to crash.
