OL,5,G0200 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Adil tries to help a Glaswegian
OL,7,     Fhiding a large cyst under his hat
OL,8,     Fand Dr Dev long arms a lipoma from
OL,9,     Fa Lancashire detective. Dr Emma
OL,10,     Fcontends with lumps on a ribcage
OL,11,     Fand a cheek.
OL,12,G0250 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FThe nation's favourite GP surgery
OL,14,     Fis back. Damian has an unsightly
OL,15,     Flump on his eye, worried mum
OL,16,     FLorena fears daughter Emma has
OL,17,     Fsleep apnoea and Peter is
OL,18,     Fstruggling with unbearable pain.
